WEBVTT

00:02:29.396 --> 00:02:32.876
This is only the first
of five lessons we have learned

00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:35.836
on our journey to become
an emission-free city.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:40.716
And I think these lessons
can be applied almost anywhere.

00:02:41.236 --> 00:02:43.156
So I like to share them.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.876
So lesson number one,

00:02:45.876 --> 00:02:49.676
confronting climate change
is about creating better cities

00:02:49.716 --> 00:02:52.516
and better quality of life for everyone.

00:02:53.036 --> 00:02:55.396
Including those kids in the kindergarten,

00:02:55.436 --> 00:02:59.436
that don't have to share
their days with noisy excavators.